  <section class="panel active" data-panel="index">
    <h2 class="section-title"><span class="num">00</span>Start Here</h2>
    <p class="lede">Everything you need before session zero, in one place.</p>
    <p>Read <strong>The Primer</strong> first, whatever your experience with the game. It's short, spoiler-free, and it's what your character would reasonably know walking into this. <strong>The City</strong> is the map — where things are, and who holds them, as far as anyone's told. <strong>Resources</strong> are official, spoiler-free rules references, safe to use any time.</p>

    <div class="index-grid">
